  "prefLabel": "Env-A 103.44 High ozone season",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 103.44 “High ozone season” means the period from June 1 through August 31 of any given calendar year.\n\nSource. #6983-A, eff 4-23-99; renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.148), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.98), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.100) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
